@yuwata I tested this earlier today and the new functionality worked great! The desired prefix hint was included in the solicit packet and the upstream router used the information. I've included a Wireshark capture of the DHCPv6 transaction. [wireshark_prefix_hint.zip](https://github.com/systemd/systemd/files/3666214/wireshark_prefix_hint.zip)
I also verified that systemd properly delegated a /64 subnet for each internal interface. Everything appears to work as expected.
Thank you everyone for the effort!
